# the stock-path fix HPU_GLM53_PENALTY_PROMPT_SET_STOCK gets its own one-node A/B). The reasoning vector (bc7c33fc + .pth 05713bf0): W1 v2 crashed in its check path 00:56 (graph compile fail
# at glm53_reasoning_vector.py:289). Without either line the image keeps stock prompt tensors and leaves the vector uninstalled.
